lisa-design:
- Policy data: store req.GetPolicyData().AsMap() in Configure (nil when unset, cleared on reconfigure) and pass it to NewPolicyProcessor, matching plugin-github-settings/plugin-aws-acm. Rejected passing nil: the agent sends policy_data in ConfigureRequest since v0.7.0 and nil would silently drop it.
- The spec named policy_manager.New; this plugin only calls NewPolicyProcessor, which gained the same policyData parameter in v0.7.0.
- go directive 1.25.8 -> 1.26.1 because agent v0.9.1's own go.mod requires go 1.26.1 (go get raised it).
- google.golang.org/protobuf becomes a direct requirement only because the new test builds a structpb.Struct.

